 his tempered-steel spear."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l033","ordinal":340150,"en":"As brave Seytek stood there,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l034","ordinal":340151,"en":"Ready to die if hostile death arrived,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l035","ordinal":340152,"en":"To stand as a shield"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l036","ordinal":340153,"en":"For the descendants left to Seytek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l037","ordinal":340154,"en":"To challenge Sarybai,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l038","ordinal":340155,"en":"And bring the battle to its appointed hour,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l039","ordinal":340156,"en":"To save the surviving line"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0577:b003:l040","ordinal":340157,"en":"From the wrathful enemy’s hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l001","ordinal":340158,"en":"“You have thrown my people into despair."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l002","ordinal":340159,"en":"You left me alive without taking vengeance,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l003","ordinal":340160,"en":"Me, brave Külchoro."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l004","ordinal":340161,"en":"You made him renowned across the earth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l005","ordinal":340162,"en":"You made Sarybai a hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l006","ordinal":340163,"en":"But Külchoro the lion—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l007","ordinal":340164,"en":"Why have you humbled him so?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l008","ordinal":340165,"en":"Casting him so often before hostile death,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l009","ordinal":340166,"en":"Why have you brought him so low?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l010","ordinal":340167,"en":"You made Sarybai mighty;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l011","ordinal":340168,"en":"Damn you, treacherous world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l012","ordinal":340169,"en":"Why have you so disgraced"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l013","ordinal":340170,"en":"This head of a true fierce lion?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l014","ordinal":340171,"en":"You shamelessly let me be bound,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l015","ordinal":340172,"en":"My two arms of a lion’s strength;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l016","ordinal":340173,"en":"You let my robe be taken as spoil,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l017","ordinal":340174,"en":"And visited this wonder upon my head."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l018","ordinal":340175,"en":"Take me, God, without tormenting me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l019","ordinal":340176,"en":"Without wearing me down in helplessness."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l020","ordinal":340177,"en":"Do not disgrace me before the multitude,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l021","ordinal":340178,"en":"Do not, before this settled nation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l022","ordinal":340179,"en":"Make Sarybai so mighty.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l023","ordinal":340180,"en":"So lamented Külchoro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l024","ordinal":340181,"en":"Grieving as he named reedy Кең-Кол and broad Talas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l025","ordinal":340182,"en":"Counting over every tract of land,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l026","ordinal":340183,"en":"Grieving for the joyous Kyrgyz, his ancestral people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l027","ordinal":340184,"en":"Counting over all the tribes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l028","ordinal":340185,"en":"He could not die though he yearned to,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l029","ordinal":340186,"en":"Could not take his own life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l030","ordinal":340187,"en":"Could not restrain the tears in his eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l031","ordinal":340188,"en":"Nor gather once again"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l032","ordinal":340189,"en":"His valiant Kyrgyz, his beloved people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l033","ordinal":340190,"en":"Unless the Almighty willed it,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l034","ordinal":340191,"en":"He could not go to death himself."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l035","ordinal":340192,"en":"He came to the gray hills and made ready,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l036","ordinal":340193,"en":"Leaning upon his gray spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l037","ordinal":340194,"en":"And halted at the great gate,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l038","ordinal":340195,"en":"Lamenting an ancient grief."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l039","ordinal":340196,"en":"Six thousand camels and countless colts,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b002:l040","ordinal":340197,"en":"The white tent bought at great price,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l001","ordinal":340198,"en":"Lions afraid and all the people weeping—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l002","ordinal":340199,"en":"A savage conflict arose."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l003","ordinal":340200,"en":"The hero despaired of life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l004","ordinal":340201,"en":"The people cried aloud in grief,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l005","ordinal":340202,"en":"Black night descended on the nation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l006","ordinal":340203,"en":"And Sarybai alone became a demon of hell."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l007","ordinal":340204,"en":"Külchoro, once aided by the spirit,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l008","ordinal":340205,"en":"Leant against Üch-Koshoy."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l009","ordinal":340206,"en":"Wounded in ninety places,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l010","ordinal":340207,"en":"His body drenched in blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l011","ordinal":340208,"en":"Beneath the hero"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l012","ordinal":340209,"en":"Six thoroughbred horses had died."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l013","ordinal":340210,"en":"His strength exhausted, he staggered,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l014","ordinal":340211,"en":"And the spirit-aided hero"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l015","ordinal":340212,"en":"Stood there dumbfounded."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l016","ordinal":340213,"en":"Damn you, treacherous world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l017","ordinal":340214,"en":"Filthy world that lives by deceit—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l018","ordinal":340215,"en":"Your deception has proven true."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l019","ordinal":340216,"en":"You cast misery upon mortals;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l020","ordinal":340217,"en":"Sarybai, son of the ogress,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l021","ordinal":340218,"en":"Was the one I lacked the strength to overcome,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l022","ordinal":340219,"en":"Yet you made him a champion and a lion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l023","ordinal":340220,"en":"At the very end, filthy world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l024","ordinal":340221,"en":"You made Sarybai a hero."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l025","ordinal":340222,"en":"You bent my precious falcon head,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l026","ordinal":340223,"en":"O treacherous world,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0578:b003:l027","ordinal":340224,"en":"And laid it level with the black earth."}]
